Thumb Rule Naming convention:
1.Packages : Use all lowercase letters - com.company.project.module 
2.Class/Interface : Use PascalCase - AzeemKaleem
3.Methods :  Use camelCase - loginToApplication
4.Variables : Use camelCase - countLetter
5.Constants (static final) : Use all uppercase - BASE_URL


Validations:
Used Assert J Dependency for Test cases validations
